	(text "Doepfer A-100 pinout: 1-2 -12V (red stripe), 3-8 GND, 9-10 +12V, 11-12 +5V, 13-14 CV, 15-16 GATE.\nFeed it from any header (usb-power J7 harness or a rack PSU, never both). 10-pin module\ncables plug in at the pin 1 end (pins 1-10). CV and GATE are bussed between the headers\nonly and are not driven on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
